    description: "Per ADR-0028 Phase 4 hard-fail. Ships piecewise per-cluster as each Phase 3 cluster's awaits_bakeoff_validation tag clears. Per-ship: remove the cluster's endpoint_shape values from EVIDENCE_TYPES in evidence_types.py; SCHEMA_VERSION minor bump; regenerate schema.json + concept-axes.md. Phase 4b prerequisites match ADR-0023's: bakeoff validation must clear for the corresponding Phase 3 subset before its 4b ships. Expect 5-7 sub-ships across the four clusters; each gets its own SCHEMA_VERSION bump. Predecessors: Phase 4a additive deprecation, plus the relevant Phase 3 cluster cleared bakeoff validation. Tag: analysis_quality."  # d9ca
